        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-03-12T13:06:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So coming back to this, we filed https://g-issues.skia.org/issues/491840505 to have a better way to do a lightweight finish proc. Given that, I think we could land this as it maintains the current behavior of empty insert recordings but introduces the `hasPendingWork()` API that will help other aspects of chrome\u0027s submission logic.\n\nWhen the new insert/submitFinsihProc API is completed, we can come back to this and also require that the command buffer actually have commands or semaphores in it.",
      "parentUuid": "0dacc074_7c074b0e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 13,
        "startChar": 52,
        "endLine": 15,
        "endChar": 10
      },
      "revId": "3e68b4c0ac642c9ad375f622f66a4482a8e1b658",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
